@* The design's announcement bar: one line of news on the brand color, a New pill, a link and a
   close button that's remembered. In an app it goes in MainLayout, above the AppHeader. *@
<Banner Status="Status.Neutral" Accent="Accent.Primary" Variant="AlertVariant.Solid" HideIcon Center Dismissible
        Remember="DismissMemory.Persistent" RememberKey="invoices-2026-11" DismissLabel="Dismiss announcement" Grow>
    <Badge Pill Size="BadgeSize.Sm" MarginEnd="1">New</Badge> Invoices are here: bill customers in four steps.
    <Anchor Href="docs/components/banner" Style="white-space: nowrap">Read the announcement</Anchor>
</Banner>
